<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>EkGuru Learning — Online Test Portal | by Prakash</title>
<meta name="description" content="EkGuru Learning by Prakash — Rajasthan Govt. exam ke liye free online test. Computer Network ke 1,556 bilingual MCQ, topic-wise practice, mock exam, Nukte aur PDF books.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 64 64'%3E%3Crect width='64' height='64' rx='10' fill='%2316283f'/%3E%3Ctext x='32' y='44' font-size='34' font-family='Arial' font-weight='bold' fill='%23ff9d2e' text-anchor='middle'%3Ee%3C/text%3E%3C/svg%3E">
<style>
/* EkGuru Learning - Online Test Portal | Design: Prakash | Navy #16283f + kesariya #E97313 | koi framework nahi, ek hi file */
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
:root{--navy:#16283f;--navy2:#0e1c2d;--navy3:#24405e;--line:#d8dfe9;--bg:#eef1f5;--paper:#fff;--org:#E97313;--org2:#ff9d2e;--ink:#1b2733;--mut:#67758a;--grn:#177245;--grnbg:#e7f5ec;--red:#b3261e;--redbg:#fdecea;--blu:#175cd3;--blubg:#eaf1fe;--pur:#6941c6;--purbg:#f1edfd;--r:8px}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{font-family:"Segoe UI",Roboto,Arial,"Noto Sans Devanagari",sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-size:15px;line-height:1.55}
a{color:var(--blu);text-decoration:none}button{font-family:inherit;cursor:pointer}
.wrap{max-width:1220px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 14px}
.Strip{background:var(--navy2);color:#ffd580;font-size:12.5px;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap;border-bottom:2px solid var(--org)}
.Strip div{display:inline-block;padding:6px 0;animation:slide 34s linear infinite}
@keyframes slide{from{transform:translateX(100vw)}to{transform:translateX(-100%)}}
header{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;position:sticky;top:0;z-index:60;box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.25)}
.hrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;padding:10px 0;flex-wrap:wrap}
.logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;color:#fff}
.logo .buddi{background:var(--org);color:#fff;font-weight:900;font-size:25px;width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:9px;display:grid;place-items:center;border:2px solid #ffb37a}
.logo b{font-size:23px}.logo b i{font-style:normal;color:var(--org2)}
.logo small{display:block;font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:3.2px;color:#9fb2c8;font-weight:700}
.byline{font-size:11px;color:#c8d6e8;border-left:1px solid #33517a;padding-left:14px;line-height:1.45}
.byline b{color:#ffd580;font-size:13px}
nav{margin-left:auto;display:flex;gap:4px;flex-wrap:wrap}
nav a{color:#d6e2f0;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;padding:8px 11px;border-radius:6px}
nav a:hover{background:var(--navy3);color:#fff}nav a.cta{background:var(--org);color:#fff}nav a.cta:hover{background:#cf6207}
.hero{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-top:1px solid #33517a;background-image:radial-gradient(#28466b 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:22px 22px}
.hero .wrap{padding:38px 14px 30px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .85fr;gap:26px;align-items:start}
.kicker{display:inline-block;background:#0e1c2d;border:1px solid #3d5d80;color:#ffd580;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:1.6px;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:20px;text-transform:uppercase}
.hero h1{font-size:37px;line-height:1.18;margin:14px 0 10px;font-weight:800}
.hero h1 .o{color:var(--org2)}.hero h1 .u{border-bottom:4px solid var(--org)}
.hero p{color:#c8d6e8;font-size:15.5px;max-width:640px}.hero p b{color:#fff}
.hbtns{display:flex;gap:10px;margin-top:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.btn{border:0;border-radius:7px;padding:13px 20px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;display:inline-block}
.btn-o{background:var(--org);color:#fff}.btn-o:hover{background:#cf6207}
.btn-g{background:transparent;color:#fff;border:1.5px solid #5b7ca3}.btn-g:hover{background:var(--navy3)}
.btn-n{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}.btn-n:hover{background:var(--navy3)}
.btn-w{background:#fff;color:var(--navy);border:1.5px solid var(--line)}.btn-w:hover{border-color:var(--navy)}
.btn:disabled{opacity:.55;cursor:wait}
.reg{background:#fff;color:var(--ink);border-radius:10px;border-top:5px solid var(--org);padding:18px 18px 14px;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(0,0,0,.3)}
.reg h3{font-size:15px;border-bottom:1px dashed var(--line);padding-bottom:8px}.reg h3 span{color:var(--org);font-size:11px}
.reg table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px;margin-top:6px}
.reg td{padding:6.5px 2px;border-bottom:1px dotted #e4e9f0}.reg td:last-child{text-align:right;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy)}
.reg .foot{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--mut);padding-top:9px}
section.blk{padding:34px 0 6px}
.shead{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px}
.shead h2{font-size:24px;color:var(--navy)}
.shead h2:before{content:"";display:inline-block;width:9px;height:22px;background:var(--org);border-radius:3px;margin-right:10px;vertical-align:-3px}
.shead .hindi{color:var(--mut);font-size:13.5px}
.ssub{color:var(--mut);font-size:14px;margin-bottom:16px;max-width:820px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(258px,1fr));gap:14px}
.subj{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--r);padding:16px;position:relative;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px}
.subj:hover{border-color:#a9bccf;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(22,40,63,.08)}
.subj .nm{font-size:17.5px;font-weight:800;color:var(--navy)}.subj .hi{color:var(--mut);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:-6px}
.subj p{font-size:13px;color:#43536a;flex:1}
.chips{display:flex;gap:5px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.chip{font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;background:#f0f3f8;border:1px solid #e0e6ee;color:#52627a;border-radius:11px;padding:2px 8px}
.tag{position:absolute;top:12px;right:12px;font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.8px;padding:3px 9px;border-radius:11px;text-transform:uppercase}
.tag.live{background:var(--grnbg);color:var(--grn);border:1px solid #a9dbc0}
.tag.soon{background:#fff4e0;color:#9a5b00;border:1px solid #ffd9a0}
.tag.make{background:var(--blubg);color:var(--blu);border:1px solid #bcd3fa}
.subj .row{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-top:2px}
.mini{font-size:12.5px;font-weight:800;padding:9px 13px;border-radius:6px;border:0}
.mini.o{background:var(--org);color:#fff}.mini.o:hover{background:#cf6207}
.mini.w{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);color:var(--navy)}
.bar{height:7px;background:#edf0f4;border-radius:4px;overflow:hidden}.bar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--org)}
.pct{font-size:11px;color:var(--mut);font-weight:700}
.panel{background:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:20px}
.setup{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(205px,1fr));gap:16px}
.fld label{display:block;font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--mut);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:7px}
.seg{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}
.seg button{background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;padding:9px 12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)}
.seg button.on{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-color:var(--navy)}
select{width:100%;padding:10px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:6px;font-size:14px;font-family:inherit;background:#fff}
.note{background:#fff8ec;border:1px solid #ffe1b3;border-left:4px solid var(--org);padding:11px 14px;border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;color:#6b4a12;margin-top:16px}
.startrow{display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}
.pool{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--mut)}.pool b{color:var(--navy)}
#player{display:none}
.qtop{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:stretch;margin-bottom:12px}
.tbox{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:7px;padding:6px 14px;text-align:center;min-width:96px}
.tbox .l{font-size:8.5px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#9fb2c8;font-weight:800}
.tbox .v{font-size:18px;font-weight:800}.tbox .v.low{color:#ff8a7a}
.tbox.light{background:#fff;color:var(--navy);border:1px solid var(--line)}.tbox.light .l{color:var(--mut)}
.pbar{height:9px;background:#e2e8f0;border-radius:5px;overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:12px}.pbar i{display:block;height:100%;background:var(--org);transition:width .25s}
.qlay{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 288px;gap:12px;align-items:start}
.qcard{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden}
.qhead{background:#f4f6fa;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 15px;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:12.5px}
.qno{font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);font-size:14px}
.bdg{font-size:10px;font-weight:800;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:10px;text-transform:uppercase}
.bdg.easy{background:var(--grnbg);color:var(--grn)}.bdg.medium{background:#fff4e0;color:#9a5b00}.bdg.hard{background:var(--redbg);color:var(--red)}.bdg.topic{background:var(--blubg);color:var(--blu)}
.qbody{padding:17px 17px 6px}.qtext{font-size:16.5px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.6}
.qtext .hi,.opt .hi{display:block;font-weight:500;color:#52627a;margin-top:3px;font-size:14px}
.opt{display:flex;gap:11px;width:100%;text-align:left;background:#fff;border:1.5px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:12px 13px;margin:0 0 9px;font-size:14.5px;align-items:flex-start}
.opt:hover{border-color:#93a9c4}
.opt .ab{flex:none;width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid #b7c5d6;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:800;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--navy)}
.opt.sel{border-color:var(--navy);background:#eef3fa}.opt.sel .ab{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-color:var(--navy)}
.opt.right{border-color:var(--grn);background:var(--grnbg)}.opt.right .ab{background:var(--grn);color:#fff;border-color:var(--grn)}
.opt.wrong{border-color:var(--red);background:var(--redbg)}.opt.wrong .ab{background:var(--red);color:#fff;border-color:var(--red)}
.expl{display:none;background:#f7faf7;border:1px solid #cfe6d6;border-left:4px solid var(--grn);border-radius:6px;padding:12px 14px;margin:4px 0 14px;font-size:13.5px}
.expl.show{display:block}.expl b.t{color:var(--grn)}
.expl .nuk{margin-top:8px;background:#fffbe9;border:1px dashed #e3cf7e;border-radius:5px;padding:8px 10px}.expl .nuk b{color:#8a6d00}
.abar{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:13px 15px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);background:#fbfcfe}
.abtn{border-radius:6px;padding:11px 15px;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:#fff;color:var(--navy)}
.abtn:hover{border-color:var(--navy)}.abtn.pri{background:var(--org);border-color:var(--org);color:#fff}.abtn.pri:hover{background:#cf6207}
.abtn.dgr{background:#fff;color:var(--red);border-color:#f0c4c0}.abtn.dgr:hover{background:var(--redbg)}
.abtn.markon{background:var(--purbg);border-color:var(--pur);color:var(--pur)}
.pal{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;padding:13px;position:sticky;top:76px}
.pal h4{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1px;color:var(--mut);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:9px}
.pgrid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,34px);gap:5px;max-height:264px;overflow:auto}
.pn{width:34px;height:32px;border-radius:5px;border:1.5px solid var(--line);background:#fff;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy)}
.pn.done{background:var(--grn);border-color:var(--grn);color:#fff}.pn.seen{background:var(--red);border-color:var(--red);color:#fff}
.pn.mark{background:var(--pur);border-color:var(--pur);color:#fff}.pn.dm{background:var(--pur);border-color:var(--pur);color:#fff;box-shadow:inset 0 -6px 0 var(--grn)}
.pn.cur{outline:3px solid var(--org2);outline-offset:1px}
.lgd{font-size:11px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:10px;line-height:2}.lgd i{display:inline-block;width:11px;height:11px;border-radius:3px;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:-1px}
#result{display:none}
.scoreband{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(140px,1fr));gap:12px;margin-bottom:14px}
.sc{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:15px;text-align:center}
.sc .v{font-size:27px;font-weight:900;color:var(--navy)}.sc .l{font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:1.2px;color:var(--mut);font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}
table.an{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:13.5px;background:#fff}
table.an th{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:9px 11px;font-size:12px}table.an td{padding:8px 11px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7ecf2}
.rev{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:8px;padding:13px 15px;margin-bottom:10px;background:#fff;font-size:13.5px}
.rev .ok{color:var(--grn);font-weight:800}.rev .bad{color:var(--red);font-weight:800}
table.bk{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);font-size:13.5px}
table.bk th{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;font-size:12px}table.bk td{padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid #e7ecf2;vertical-align:top}
.steps{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(215px,1fr));gap:13px}
.step{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:16px}
.step .n{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900;margin-bottom:9px}
.step b{color:var(--navy);display:block;margin-bottom:4px}.step p{font-size:13px;color:#43536a}
.examline{display:flex;gap:7px;flex-wrap:wrap}
footer{background:var(--navy2);color:#9fb2c8;margin-top:44px;padding:30px 0 22px;font-size:13px}
footer b{color:#fff}footer .cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(220px,1fr));gap:20px}
footer a{color:#c8d6e8;display:block;padding:3px 0}footer a:hover{color:#ffd580}
.copyright{border-top:1px solid #24405e;margin-top:20px;padding-top:14px;font-size:12px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.toast{position:fixed;left:50%;bottom:22px;transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(80px);background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:12px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:700;z-index:99;transition:transform .3s;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.3);max-width:92vw;text-align:center}
.toast.show{transform:translateX(-50%) translateY(0)}
dialog{border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:0;max-width:520px;width:93vw;box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35)}
dialog::backdrop{background:rgba(10,22,38,.62)}.dlg{padding:22px}.dlg h3{color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:5px}.dlg p{font-size:13.5px;color:#43536a}
@media(max-width:900px){.hero .wrap{grid-template-columns:1fr}.hero h1{font-size:29px}.qlay{grid-template-columns:1fr}.pal{position:static}.byline{display:none}}
@media(max-width:560px){nav a{padding:7px 8px;font-size:12px}.abtn{flex:1 1 44%;text-align:center}.logo b{font-size:19px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="Strip"><div>📢 &nbsp; Computer Network ka poora test LIVE hai — 1,556 bilingual MCQ &nbsp;•&nbsp; DBMS, Java, SAD aur Geography ka content tayyar ho raha hai &nbsp;•&nbsp; Har question ke saath Answer + Nukta (exam point) &nbsp;•&nbsp; Koi sign-up nahi, koi paisa nahi — seedha test shuru karo &nbsp;•&nbsp; EkGuru Learning • by Prakash &nbsp;&nbsp;📢 &nbsp; Computer Network LIVE — 1,556 MCQ &nbsp;•&nbsp; EkGuru Learning • by Prakash</div></div>

<header><div class="wrap hrow">
  <a class="logo" href="#top"><span class="buddi">e</span><span><b>Ek<i>Guru</i></b><small>LEARNING • ONLINE TEST</small></span></a>
  <div class="byline">Curated &amp; compiled by<br><b>Prakash</b> — EkGuru Learning</div>
  <nav><a href="#subjects">Subjects</a><a href="#test">Test Centre</a><a href="#books">Books &amp; PDF</a><a href="#kaise">Kaise Kaam Karta Hai</a><a class="cta" href="#test">▶ Test Shuru Karo</a></nav>
</div></header>

<div class="hero" id="top"><div class="wrap">
  <div>
    <span class="kicker">Rajasthan Govt. Exams • Free Online Test</span>
    <h1>Ghar baithe <span class="o">Online Test</span> do,<br>har answer ke saath <span class="u">Nukta</span> samjho.</h1>
    <p><b>EkGuru Learning</b> par pehla subject — <b>Computer Network</b> — pura live hai: <b>1,556 bilingual (EN + हिंदी) MCQ</b>, 7 topics, asli exam papers aur Forouzan se cross-checked answers. Baaki subjects ki kitaabein ban rahi hain — jaise hi tayyar, yahi par test khul jayega.</p>
    <div class="hbtns"><a class="btn btn-o" href="#test">▶ &nbsp;Abhi Test Do — Free</a><a class="btn btn-g" href="#subjects">Saare Subjects Dekho</a></div>
    <p style="margin-top:14px;font-size:12.5px">✓ No sign-up &nbsp; ✓ Mobile par bhi chalega &nbsp; ✓ Result turant &nbsp; ✓ Galti par turant samjhaya jayega</p>
  </div>
  <div class="reg">
    <h3>📋 Aaj ka Register <span>— EKGURU RECORD</span></h3>
    <table>
      <tr><td>Live Subject</td><td>Computer Network</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Total Questions</td><td id="rTotal">1,556</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Topics</td><td>7 (Topic-wise Test)</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Language</td><td>English + हिंदी</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Har Question me</td><td>Answer + ★ Nukta</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Aapke diye Tests</td><td id="rMine">0</td></tr>
      <tr><td>Aapka Best Score</td><td id="rBest">—</td></tr>
    </table>
    <div class="foot">Ye register aapke hi phone/browser me rehta hai (local record). Kahin upload nahi hota.</div>
  </div>
</div></div>

<section class="blk" id="subjects"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="shead"><h2>Saare Subjects</h2><span class="hindi">सभी विषय — jo tayyar hai woh live, jo ban raha hai woh saaf likha hai</span></div>
  <p class="ssub">Jhootha vaada nahi karte. Jis subject ka question bank verify ho gaya, uska test <b style="color:var(--grn)">LIVE</b> hai. Baaki par kaam chal raha hai — progress bhi neeche dikh raha hai.</p>
  <div class="grid" id="subGrid"></div>
</div></section>

<section class="blk" id="test"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="shead"><h2>Test Centre</h2><span class="hindi">परीक्षा केंद्र — apna test khud banao</span></div>
  <p class="ssub">Topic chuno, mode chuno, kitne question chahiye wo chuno — bas. <b>Practice Mode</b> me har question ke turant baad sahi jawab aur Nukta milega. <b>Exam Mode</b> me asli paper jaisa mahaul — timer, palette, negative marking aur aakhir me pura result.</p>

  <div class="panel" id="setupPanel">
    <div class="setup">
      <div class="fld"><label>1 · Subject</label>
        <select id="fSubject"><option value="cn">🖧 Computer Network — LIVE (1,556 Q)</option></select>
        <div class="pool" style="margin-top:6px">Baaki subjects upar wale Cards se dekho — tayyar hote hi yahan jud jayenge.</div></div>
      <div class="fld"><label>2 · Topic</label><div class="seg" id="fTopic"></div></div>
      <div class="fld"><label>3 · Mode</label><div class="seg" id="fMode">
        <button data-v="practice" class="on">✎ Practice</button><button data-v="exam">⏱ Exam</button></div>
        <div class="pool" id="modeNote" style="margin-top:6px">Practice: jawab dete hi sahi/galti + Nukta dikhega.</div></div>
      <div class="fld"><label>4 · Kitne Question?</label><div class="seg" id="fCount">
        <button data-v="10">10</button><button data-v="20" class="on">20</button><button data-v="30">30</button><button data-v="50">50</button><button data-v="100">100</button></div></div>
      <div class="fld"><label>5 · Difficulty</label><div class="seg" id="fDiff">
        <button data-v="all" class="on">Sab</button><button data-v="easy">Easy</button><button data-v="medium">Medium</button><button data-v="hard">Hard</button></div></div>
      <div class="fld"><label>6 · Bhasha / Language</label><div class="seg" id="fLang">
        <button data-v="both" class="on">EN + हिंदी</button><button data-v="en">English</button><button data-v="hi">हिंदी</button></div></div>
      <div class="fld" id="negWrap" style="display:none"><label>7 · Negative Marking (Exam)</label><div class="seg" id="fNeg">
        <button data-v="0" class="on">Nahi</button><button data-v="0.25">−0.25</button><button data-v="0.5">−0.50</button></div></div>
      <div class="fld"><label>Question Pool</label><div class="pool" id="poolInfo" style="font-size:14px;padding-top:8px">Bank load ho raha hai…</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="note">📌 <b>Sach baat:</b> is bank ke questions Rajasthan ke asli papers (RPSC Programmer, BCI/SCI, IA…) aur Forouzan ki kitab se liye gaye hain, answers cross-check kiye gaye hain. Phir bhi kahin galti dikhe to wahi question ka <b>Question ID</b> note karke batao — agle update me sudhar jayega.</div>
    <div class="startrow">
      <button class="btn btn-o" id="btnStart" disabled>Bank load ho raha hai…</button>
      <button class="btn btn-w" id="btnRandom">🎲 Surprise Test (Random 20)</button>
      <span class="pool">Question har baar shuffle hote hain — do baar ek jaisa paper nahi milega.</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="player">
    <div class="qtop">
      <div class="tbox light"><div class="l">QUESTION</div><div class="v" id="tQno">1 / 20</div></div>
      <div class="tbox light"><div class="l">ANSWERED</div><div class="v" id="tAns">0</div></div>
      <div class="tbox light"><div class="l">SCORE (LIVE)</div><div class="v" id="tScore">0</div></div>
      <div class="tbox" id="timerBox"><div class="l">⏱ SAMAY BACHAA</div><div class="v" id="tTime">--:--</div></div>
      <button class="abtn" id="btnPalette" style="margin-left:auto">☷ Palette</button>
      <button class="abtn dgr" id="btnFinishTop">✔ Test Khatm Karo</button>
    </div>
    <div class="pbar"><i id="pFill" style="width:0%"></i></div>
    <div class="qlay">
      <div class="qcard">
        <div class="qhead"><span class="qno" id="qNo">Q.1</span><span class="bdg topic" id="qTopic">Topic</span><span class="bdg medium" id="qDiff">Medium</span><span style="color:var(--mut)" id="qId"></span><span style="margin-left:auto;color:var(--mut)" id="qSrc"></span></div>
        <div class="qbody"><div class="qtext" id="qText"></div><div id="optBox" style="margin-top:14px"></div><div class="expl" id="explBox"></div></div>
        <div class="abar">
          <button class="abtn" id="btnPrev">← Pichhla</button>
          <button class="abtn" id="btnClear">✕ Jawab Hatao</button>
          <button class="abtn" id="btnMark">⚑ Mark for Review</button>
          <button class="abtn pri" id="btnNext">Agla →</button>
          <button class="abtn dgr" id="btnFinish" style="margin-left:auto">✔ Submit Test</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <aside class="pal" id="palBox"><h4>Question Palette</h4><div class="pgrid" id="pGrid"></div>
        <div class="lgd"><i style="background:var(--grn)"></i>Jawab diya &nbsp;<i style="background:var(--red)"></i>Dekha, jawab nahi<br><i style="background:var(--pur)"></i>Review ke liye mark &nbsp;<i style="background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line)"></i>Abhi dekha nahi</div>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="result">
    <div class="scoreband" id="scoreBand"></div>
    <div class="panel" style="margin-bottom:14px">
      <div class="shead"><h2 style="font-size:19px">Topic-wise Haal</h2><span class="hindi">कहाँ galti hui, saaf dikhega</span></div>
      <div style="overflow:auto"><table class="an" id="anTable"></table></div>
      <div class="startrow"><button class="btn btn-o" id="btnAgain">↻ Ek Aur Test</button>
      <button class="btn btn-w" id="btnWrong">Sirf Galat Wale Dobara (<span id="wrongN">0</span>)</button>
      <button class="btn btn-n" id="btnReview">Saare Jawab Dekho ↓</button></div>
    </div>
    <div id="revBox"></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="blk" id="books"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="shead"><h2>Books &amp; PDF</h2><span class="hindi">किताबें — padhna ho to PDF, test dena ho to upar</span></div>
  <p class="ssub">Har topic ki alag kitab hai — left side question, right side sahi jawab aur ★ Nukta. Neeche se seedha download karo. Practice booklet me poora bank hai, theory book me pehle padhai phir sawaal.</p>
  <div style="overflow:auto"><table class="bk"><thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Topic</th><th>Kya-kya hai isme</th><th>Online</th><th>Theory + MCQ Book</th><th>Practice Booklet</th></tr></thead><tbody id="bkBody"></tbody></table></div>
  <div class="note">📘 Ek hi file me sab chahiye? <a href="Computer%20Network/The%20Complete%20Computer%20Network%20-%20Theory%20%2B%20631%20MCQs%20(Answers%20%2B%20Nukte).pdf" target="_blank"><b>The Complete Computer Network — Theory + 631 MCQs (PDF)</b></a></div>
</div></section>

<section class="blk" id="kaise"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="shead"><h2>Kaise Kaam Karta Hai</h2><span class="hindi">तरीका — chaar kadam, bas</span></div>
  <div class="steps">
    <div class="step"><div class="n">1</div><b>Topic chuno</b><p>OSI Model kamzor hai? Sirf Topic 2 ka test do. Poora CN ek saath bhi de sakte ho — "Sab Topics" chuno.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="n">2</div><b>Practice se shuru karo</b><p>Galti karna hi seekhna hai. Practice mode me har sawaal ke turant baad sahi jawab, wajah aur ★ Nukta milta hai.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="n">3</div><b>Phir Exam mode</b><p>Timer ke saath, bina turant jawab dekhe. Ye bilkul asli paper ka rehearsal hai — negative marking bhi laga sakte ho.</p></div>
    <div class="step"><div class="n">4</div><b>Galtiyan dobara do</b><p>Result ke baad "Sirf Galat Wale Dobara" dabao. Jo sawaal galat hue, wahi phir se — jab tak pakke na ho jayein.</p></div>
  </div>
  <div class="panel" style="margin-top:14px">
    <div class="shead"><h2 style="font-size:18px">Kin Exams ke Kaam ka Hai</h2></div>
    <div class="examline"><span class="chip">RPSC Programmer</span><span class="chip">RSMSSB Informatics Assistant (IA)</span><span class="chip">BCI — Basic Computer Instructor</span><span class="chip">SCI — Senior Computer Instructor</span><span class="chip">School Administrator (SA)</span><span class="chip">Data Entry / Computer Operator</span><span class="chip">REET (Computer)</span><span class="chip">RAS &amp; anya Rajasthan Govt. Exams</span></div>
    <p style="font-size:13px;color:var(--mut);margin-top:10px">Reference book: <b>Behrouz A. Forouzan — Data Communications and Networking</b>. Sawaal repo me rakhe asli exam papers se liye gaye hain.</p>
  </div>
</div></section>

